00:04:28.971 --> 00:04:30.247
- Yeah.

00:04:30.247 --> 00:04:32.973
- And is being a grandparent
cooler than being a parent?

00:04:32.973 --> 00:04:36.886
- Of course, and I wasn't
really ready to be a grandparent

00:04:36.886 --> 00:04:38.915
because you know most of
us see ourselves as young

00:04:38.915 --> 00:04:41.410
and grandfathers are
like "I don't know how to

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:42.454
"fix a washing machine."

00:04:42.454 --> 00:04:44.380
(Kelly laughing)

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.586
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh she's adorable!

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:49.321
- [Cedric] Little Kylo,
she's a sweetheart.

00:04:49.321 --> 00:04:50.565
- [Kelly] She's adorable

00:04:50.565 --> 00:04:52.665
- Yeah she's a sweetheart, she's so,

00:04:52.665 --> 00:04:54.832
she calls my Popsy, Popsy.

00:04:56.085 --> 00:04:57.200
- And you just wanna give her everything.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.378
- And that's my little grand cookie,

00:04:58.378 --> 00:04:59.449
that's what I call her.

00:04:59.449 --> 00:05:02.871
- You call her grand cookie,
that's so cute, oh my god.

00:05:02.871 --> 00:05:04.596
- Its great though, but it's like you say

00:05:04.596 --> 00:05:07.350
being a grandparent you get
to have the fun cute moments

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.355
and then you go "Okay, bye bye."

00:05:09.355 --> 00:05:12.340
(laughing)

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:15.483
- All right I wanna know,
I love it, I can't wait.

00:05:15.483 --> 00:05:17.353
I feel like my kids are so mean sometimes,

00:05:17.353 --> 00:05:18.951
they're so cute but they can be so mean,

00:05:18.951 --> 00:05:20.911
and I can't wait to be a grandparent,

00:05:20.911 --> 00:05:21.750
because then you load them up

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.174
with sugar and you're like "Bye."

00:05:23.174 --> 00:05:24.744
- Yeah exactly.
- Yeah.

00:05:24.744 --> 00:05:25.844
- Everything, she can have it all

00:05:25.844 --> 00:05:27.466
and then I'm like "Okay bye bye."

00:05:27.466 --> 00:05:29.017
- Yeah and then I'm like "peace."

00:05:29.017 --> 00:05:31.439
What is it like when you
go into a barbershop?

00:05:31.439 --> 00:05:33.585
I'm just curious.

00:05:33.585 --> 00:05:35.790
'Cause I mean, you know what I'm saying.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.639
